---
import BaseLayout from '@layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="About — Agent Literacy">
  <nav class="site-nav">
    <a href="/" class="wordmark">Agent Literacy</a>
    <div class="nav-links">
      <a href="/about" class="nav-link active">About</a>
      <a href="/contact" class="nav-link">Contact</a>
    </div>
  </nav>

  <article class="page-content">
    <h1>About Agent Literacy</h1>
    <div class="prose">
      <p>We're in the early days of a fundamental shift in how people work. AI agents aren't just tools that execute commands — they're collaborators that can reshape how you think about problems.</p>
      <p>Agent Literacy exists to help people navigate this shift. Not with hype or fear, but with practical frameworks, honest observations, and real examples of what human-agent collaboration looks like when it's done well.</p>
      <p>This site is built by someone figuring this out in real time, sharing what they learn along the way. If you're curious about working with agents — whether for yourself or your team — you're in the right place.</p>
    </div>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .site-nav {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    padding: 24px 32px;
    max-width: 720px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .wordmark {
    font-size: 13px;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: -0.3px;
    color: var(--color-text);
  }

  .nav-links {
    display: flex;
    gap: 24px;
  }

  .nav-link {
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    font-size: 13px;
    font-weight: 500;
    transition: color var(--transition-fast);
  }

  .nav-link:hover,
  .nav-link.active {
    color: var(--color-text);
  }

  .page-content {
    max-width: 720px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 6vh 24px 100px;
  }

  h1 {
    font-size: 28px;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: -0.5px;
    margin-bottom: 32px;
  }

  .prose {
    font: var(--font-body);
    color: var(--color-text-secondary);
  }

  .prose p {
    margin-bottom: 20px;
    line-height: 1.8;
  }

  @media (max-width: 600px) {
    .site-nav { padding: 20px 20px; }
    .page-content { padding: 4vh 20px 80px; }
    h1 { font-size: 24px; }
  }
</style>
